<https://blueprinting.dlab5.net/i/patterns/Assessment/assessment-npm-ci-rejects-amplify-lockfile> a archimate:Assessment;
    archimate:identifier "assessment-npm-ci-rejects-amplify-lockfile";
    archimate:name "npm ci rejects a backend lockfile npm itself wrote";
    archimate:documentation "Several Amplify CDK packages ship bundled dependencies. npm install records the hoisted version while npm ci rebuilds an ideal tree containing the bundled one, and the two disagree. Reproducible from a clean install; use npm install for the backend phase.";
    archimate:hasProperty _:p-e-assessment-npm-ci-rejects-amplify-lockfile-0.
_:p-e-assessment-npm-ci-rejects-amplify-lockfile-0 a archimate:Property;
    archimate:propertyKey "reference";
    archimate:propertyValue "docs/adr/0001; digitalhome-cloud-core amplify.yml".
<https://blueprinting.dlab5.net/i/patterns/Assessment/assessment-repin-is-a-swap> a archimate:Assessment;
    archimate:identifier "assessment-repin-is-a-swap";
    archimate:name "Re-pinning becomes a swap rather than a merge";
    archimate:documentation "Observed twice. It is also what makes two versions of a language coexistable: the overlay carries a version discriminator on only the terms that differ, which for application conventions is usually none.";
    archimate:hasProperty _:p-e-assessment-repin-is-a-swap-0.
_:p-e-assessment-repin-is-a-swap-0 a archimate:Property;
    archimate:propertyKey "instances";
    archimate:propertyValue "digitalhome-cloud-core; blueprinting-dlab5-net".
<https://blueprinting.dlab5.net/i/patterns/Assessment/assessment-saved-workspaces-go-stale> a archimate:Assessment;
    archimate:identifier "assessment-saved-workspaces-go-stale";
    archimate:name "A workspace saved against older block definitions stops opening";
    archimate:documentation "Recorded by the DHC harness against its own files, which named the fix before anyone acted on it. Where blocks are generated from an ontology that will be re-pinned, this is certain rather than possible.";
    archimate:hasProperty _:p-e-assessment-saved-workspaces-go-stale-0.
_:p-e-assessment-saved-workspaces-go-stale-0 a archimate:Property;
    archimate:propertyKey "instances";
    archimate:propertyValue "digitalhome-cloud-designer".
